+// SOTN Co-op (design/M13-partner-player.md): a second bank of 512 lines after VRAM, for the
+// partner's textures and palettes. Uploads reach it with bit 9 of their y; a primitive reads
+// its texture page from it with bit 14 of its texpage (E1 for rectangles), and its palette with
+// bit 15 of its palette (rows 512 and up). Drawing and the display stay in bank 0. Software
+// renderer only.
+inline constexpr uint32_t VRAM_BANK_LINES = 512, VRAM_BANK_FLAG = 0x200, VRAM_STORAGE_HEIGHT = 1024;
